      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 09 · AI Support Ticket Triage\nClassifies incoming tickets by category, priority and sentiment, routes urgent ones to on-call and posts a suggested first reply.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/ticket-triage` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"ticket_id\": \"T-9812\",\n \"customer_email\": \"user@client.com\",\n \"subject\": \"Dashboard down\",\n \"body\": \"Since 10am none of our team can log in, we get a 500 error. This is blocking all work.\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
